{"beat": 20, "name": "MIDNIGHT", "text": "At 12:01 a.m. on January 1, 1913, the Postmaster General, Frank Hitchcock, put one of the new service's first parcels into the mail: a silver trophy cup, addressed to the postmaster of New York, Edward Morgan. A second cup went the other way, from New York to Washington. Both are in the Smithsonian's postal collection, and the museum's own records give each of them a claim to being first. It was publicity, and it worked. But a cup isn't the interesting thing that started that night. The interesting thing was printed on a card.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "At", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.22}, {"word": "12:01", "start": 0.22, "end": 1.3}, {"word": "a.m.", "start": 1.3, "end": 2.32}, {"word": "on", "start": 2.98, "end": 3.18}, {"word": "January", "start": 3.18, "end": 3.56}, {"word": "1,", "start": 3.56, "end": 4.08}, {"word": "1913,", "start": 4.28, "end": 5.18}, {"word": "the", "start": 5.86, "end": 5.86}, {"word": "Postmaster", "start": 5.86, "end": 6.38}, {"word": "General,", "start": 6.38, "end": 7.0}, {"word": "Frank", "start": 7.0, "end": 7.34}, {"word": "Hitchcock,", "start": 7.34, "end": 7.94}, {"word": "put", "start": 7.94, "end": 8.42}, {"word": "one", "start": 8.42, "end": 8.6}, {"word": "of", "start": 8.6, "end": 8.7}, {"word": "the", "start": 8.7, "end": 8.8}, {"word": "new", "start": 8.8, "end": 8.98}, {"word": "service's", "start": 8.98, "end": 9.68}, {"word": "first", "start": 9.68, "end": 9.88}, {"word": "parcels", "start": 9.88, "end": 10.48}, {"word": "into", "start": 10.48, "end": 10.7}, {"word": "the", "start": 10.7, "end": 10.88}, {"word": "mail:", "start": 10.88, "end": 11.16}, {"word": "a", "start": 11.74, "end": 11.86}, {"word": "silver", "start": 11.86, "end": 12.2}, {"word": "trophy", "start": 12.2, "end": 12.68}, {"word": "cup,", "start": 12.68, "end": 13.08}, {"word": "addressed", "start": 13.08, "end": 13.64}, {"word": "to", "start": 13.64, "end": 13.98}, {"word": "the", "start": 1